      "content": "The void you feel is the space where your old life used to be, and it's a vast, empty place. Rebuilding after this kind of collapse is a monumental, slow process, and you don't have to do it alone. Focus on taking the smallest possible steps forward, even if they feel insignificant, like just getting through the next hour. Professional support can help you navigate this immense shift in your identity and find a new footing.",
