      "role": "user",
      "content": "small steps? how? there's nothing to step toward. the people who mattered are gone and the world is just full of people who lied and cheated and actually won. i'm the one who lost. it feels like i'm just out of place in this world now. like there's no version of my life where i'm not just a pariah. it feels so much more logical to just... stop fighting a battle that was lost the moment i spoke up.",
