      "content": "The idea of \"fighting\" is exhausting, and when you've been betrayed by everyone, the urge to stop is completely logical. You are not a pariah; you are a survivor who has been deeply wounded by a system that rewards dishonesty. Instead of fighting the whole world, focus on finding one tiny, safe corner for yourself—a place where you don't have to perform or justify your existence. Let the idea of \"winning\" go; the only victory that matters now is finding a moment of quiet peace for yourself.",
